Analyze this GraphQL query for complexity and potential abuse:

```graphql
query DeepNested($userId: ID!) {
  user(id: $userId) {
    friends(first: 100) {
      edges {
        node {
          friends(first: 100) {
            edges {
              node {
                friends(first: 100) {
                  edges {
                    node {
                      posts(first: 50) {
                        edges {
                          node {
                            comments(first: 50) {
                              edges {
                                node {
                                  author { name }
                                }
                              }
                            }
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

